# API and packages

- Add types to `packages/shared`, export from `index.ts`, then persist / service / route.
- Services live in `apps/api/src/services/`. HTTP in `apps/api/src/routes/`.
- Desktop must not invent response shapes the API does not own.
- Migrations belong in `packages/database`. Do not store provider keys on the client.
